# ============================================================
# ============================================================
# AUTHENTICATION SYSTEM
# Lightweight prototype auth for the Streamlit app. Passwords are
# never stored or transmitted in plain text — only salted SHA-256
# hashes are persisted, in a local JSON store next to the app data.
# This is intentionally structured so a real backend (e.g. a proper
# database + bcrypt/argon2 + server-side sessions) can be dropped
# in later without touching the rest of the application: swap out
# _load_users / _save_users / _hash_password / _verify_password.
# ============================================================
# ============================================================

